  "Starting cards as posted under Starting (8): Hidden Base / Systems Will Slip Through Your Fingers, Rendezvous Point, 'Hidden Marker', Podrace Prep, Haven, Tatooine: Podrace Arena, Anakin's Podracer, Boonta Eve Podrace; these count toward the 60.",
  "Posted 'Hidden Marker' is kept as written: it is the face-down system that marks the 'Hidden Base' planet, and the post does not name which system it is. It is counted, which makes the published total 60.",
  "Posted 'Epic Event I Did It' (below the Locations, outside any section count) dested the Tatooine Epic Event I Did It!.",
  "Posted 'Courscant' dested the Special Edition Light Coruscant system (Force drain +1 there), chosen for this drain deck over the Coruscant-set printing.",
  "Posted 'Star Destroyer' dested the Light Special Edition interrupt Star Destroyer!; 'Kashyk' dested Kashyyyk; 'Aquarius' dested Aquaris; 'Malastere' dested Malastare; 'Dash Rednar' dested Dash Rendar; 'Boush' dested Boushh.",
